  "title": "E27c: E27b plus the prefill cadence kept while requests are queued",
  "outcome": "promote",
  "outcome_detail": "Owner accepted. Against the frozen E27 medians: C4 per-stream TTFT -27.1%, C2 +2.4%, C4 +1.2%, code decode +1.8%, prose +1.5%, C1 end-to-end -1.8%, cold prefill -1.6% to -3.3%, replay -0.3% to -1.6%. With four 32K prompts arriving together, the first stream decodes at 11.3-12.5 tok/s instead of 6.1-6.2 and the last starts about 7% later. With a single long arrival it behaves as E27b.",
